{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09451","headline":"射雉 · 韦应物","name":"射雉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"走马上东冈，朝日照野田。\n野田双雉起，翻射斗回鞭。\n虽无百发中，聊取一笑妍。\n羽分绣臆碎，头弛锦鞘悬。\n方将悦羁旅，非关学少年。\n弢弓一长啸，忆在灞城阡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}